@ERP.Web.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### Liveness (anonymous)
GET {{ERP.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/api/diagnostics/ping
Accept: application/json

### Readiness (database connectivity)
GET {{ERP.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Login - copy data.accessToken into @token below
POST {{ERP.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sa/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "<your-password>"
}

### Authenticated example: chart of accounts
@token = <paste-access-token>
GET {{ERP.Web.Api_HostAddress}}/api/gl/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
